  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for United Nations Children&apos;s Fund&apos;s Access to COVID-19 Tools Accelerator</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNICEF&#x2019;s ACT-A Supply Financing Fund will be supported with DKK 30 million in order to; support the procurement of 50-100 million doses of COVID-19 vaccines, the procurement of 500 million syringes, 10,000 refrigerators, and freight and in-country delivery costs for receiving countries. The grant has been earmarked within the Geographic Priorities sub-category of the Immunization Category (Category I), prioritized towards supporting those AMC92 eligible countries which are located in Africa.</narrative>
  </description>
